# Jetpack Joyride (PCSE00213): title "Tap rear touch pad to play" > rear tap > a run, flying with long rear-pad touches
# run: VitaSharp.Desktop --data=<root> run PCSE00213 --headless --seconds=180 --nav=tests/nav/jetpack_rear.nav
wait 900
shot title
