wait 120
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
btap 0.5 0.5 45
wait 60
shot run
wait 900
shot later
